{"key":"map/gz5g","relations":[{"id":"person","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/skd","title":"Old Dragon","variant":""}],"title":"Related characters"},{"id":"inhabitant","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"creature/scrabmotherhealthf20","title":"Armadillo mother (variant 1)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/scrabbluef5","title":"Baby armadillo (variant 1)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/scrabgreyf5","title":"Baby armadillo (variant 2)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/elementalearthf8","title":"Earth elemental","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/evileyesimplem6","title":"Evileye cub (variant 2)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/ratsmallf1","title":"Rat","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/orcmalef3","title":"Young Orc","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/orcfemalerunetm3","title":"Young Orc seer (variant 3)","variant":""}],"title":"Creatures and people"},{"id":"quest","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"quest/q5g","title":"Finding magic bit","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"quest/q22g","title":"Subterranean creatures","variant":""}],"title":"Quests"},{"id":"exit","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/gz9g","title":"Dead City","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz3g","title":"Foothills","variant":""}],"title":"Connected locations"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Cave</h1><p>A large catacomb with several exits on the surface. Even the tough Orcs only managed to bring a small part of the cave under control, and they will not risk venturing into its depths where strange and unfamiliar creatures dwell.<br /></p><h2>The brigands’ trail and the Magic Bit</h2><p>Babur’s account of a red-haired brigand meeting orcs gives Zak his next lead. A map taken from Redhead points to a Magic Bit in a sarcophagus in the orc cave. Babur explains that Estera values such objects, while Gort can supply the missing drawbridge mechanism. Zak obtains the seer’s key and the object, then asks how to reach the witch. Babur, who made her spare trap key, explains the guarded ravines and controlling obelisks. The craftsman expects a share of the sale. Zak instead intends to exchange the find for help with his lost memory. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]</p><h2>The Old Dragon on Lone Mountain</h2><p>The observatory’s password takes Zak into the Dead City and up Lone Mountain. He expects the magician from the Orb but finds <a href=\"wiki://character/skd\">Old Dragon</a>. The dragon insists on an old bargain: a visitor must perform a task before receiving an answer. Zak deals with the armadillos beneath the lair, using the poison the dragon supplies. The dragon then admits that he cannot identify Zak or locate Gipath’s elusive Great Magician. He suggests the ancient lizards might know more and points instead to an expedition of armoured outsiders. He withdraws the skeletons he had used against their camp. In a further conversation, he gives Zak an old sword because he enjoys his company and would rather not see him become another speechless skeleton. [9, 10, 11, 12, 13]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original dialogue, quest journals and world descriptions. Source numbers identify the evidence listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/smith\">Babur the Tightfist</a> (briefing m4)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/smith\">Babur the Tightfist</a> (briefing m5_1)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/sheriff\">Gort the Skullcrusher</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing v4)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/smith\">Babur the Tightfist</a> (briefing m6)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/smith\">Babur the Tightfist</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing m6_1)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Quest journal · Getting redhead brigand's stuff (quest q4g)</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Quest journal · Finding magic bit (quest q5g)</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Quest journal · Reaching the witch (quest q6g)</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Quest journal · Dead City master (quest q20g)</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/skd\">Old Dragon</a> (briefing dr20)</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>Quest journal · Subterranean creatures (quest q22g)</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/skd\">Old Dragon</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing dr22)</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/skd\">Old Dragon</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing dr22_1)</td></tr></table><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Island</td><td><a href=\"wiki://allod/gipat\">Gipath</a></td></tr></table><h2>Connected locations</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Maps</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz3g\">Foothills</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz9g\">Dead City</a></td></tr></table><h2>Quests</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Quests</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/q22g\">Subterranean creatures</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/q5g\">Finding magic bit</a></td></tr></table><h2>Related characters</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/skd\">Old Dragon</a></td></tr></table><h2>Creatures and people</h2><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Related page</th><th>Details</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/scrabmotherhealthf20\">Armadillo mother (variant 1)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/scrabbluef5\">Baby armadillo (variant 1)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/scrabgreyf5\">Baby armadillo (variant 2)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\